+- `factory-runs-RECORDED.json`, `factory-runners-RECORDED.json`: RECORDED from
+  the public GitHub Actions API (executiveusa/vibe-engineering) on 2026-10-24
+  ~02:15 CST. `runners total_count 0` is the real recorded state. Account-owner
+  email addresses in the recorded payloads are redacted in the relay export.
+- `gateway-districts-CODE-DERIVED.json`: CODE-DERIVED, NOT live-recorded. No
+  live /v1/districts payload has ever been recorded. Generated by the
+  architect's `fixtures/0039-genboard.js` (relay branch), which runs the real
+  `decide()` + `itemFromIssue()` from `sidecar/district-foreman.js` over the
+  real `registry/districts.json` (pauli-starnet local branch
+  `claude/factory-v1-architect` @ 33d69d3ea) and wraps the board exactly as
+  `gateway/server.js:629-634` does (`{...board, age_seconds, stale}`). Only the
+  two issues are synthetic (#101 approved -> DISPATCH, #102 unapproved ->
+  BLOCKED with the approve question). Three cases: `ok` (age 120s), `stale`
+  (age 1800s, stale:true), `noTick` (503 NO_FOREMAN_TICK body).
+- Field names per architect board 0039 (real code path): top level
+  `at, queued_items, errors, districts, age_seconds, stale`; per district
+  `district, active, queued, action, issue?, attempt?, question?, reason?,
+  mission_id?`. The board carries no foreman exit code (`last_exit` renders
+  'unknown', never null-as-success) and no next_run field (derived as `at` +
+  5 min timer cadence).
